<title>USA: Halifax sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Halifax sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>ALEXANDRIA, Va. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Halifax Corp said Monday it approved a three-for-two stock split of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>The company said the split will be effective for shareholders of record December 13, 1996.</p>
<p>Halifax has about 1.33 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The additional shares will be mailed or delivered on December 27, 1996 by the company's transfer agent, American Stock Transfer &amp; Trust Co, Halifax said.</p>
